            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThis can already be (virtually) done [by setting a very large delay](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/072ef026a538cf4a9dedba56ad8eecffa9e9abb6/doc/mini-completion.txt#L175-L176). This can also be done to implement toggling.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
